.93,0:05:31.43,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Limitless power surgesComment: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:34.64,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As long as you wish,Comment: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:37.21,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll brandish our unchanging bondComment: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:51.52,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:58.83,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:05.67,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:12.44,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:15.61,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:19.02,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.92,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:25.62,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:29.69,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:33.13,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:36.33,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.87,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:43.51,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:46.01,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:48.81,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:55.55,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,decided long ago in the pastComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Jinbe,,0,0,0,code once,a = 10 ; b = -10 ; d = 5Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Jinbe,,0,0,0,code syl all, if syl.i < (#line.ka