0.53,0:01:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a .36 Caliber Walker Percussion Pistol.Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:08.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It fires bullets known as "Candy Jackets".Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,They're powerful enough to pierce through armored soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,But you've already witnessed its power firsthand, right?Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.55,0:01:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,These bullets will be able to penetrate all of your metal-enhanced bodies.Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for tomorrow!Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:35.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to see Sanji's face when I, the one he trusts, points a gun at his head.Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:40.83,Main,,0,0,1,,I can't wait to see that!Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:45.63,CaptionsBig,,530,0,295,,The JellyDialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:45.63,CaptionsBig,,0,600,315,,The CarpetDialogue: 0,0:01:40.83,0:01:45.41,Main,,0,0,1,,He truly believes that you love him!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be something to see.Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:58.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What will his face look like?Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Maybe it'll look like this?Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,– That's perfect! – You're so funny!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Or maybe like this?Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.36,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Pudding-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:24.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You aren't paying attention.Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We're talking about your brother.Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,She's right. Why don't you listen?Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:33.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:37.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know how he proposed to me?Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:42.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! It was perfect!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.92,0:02:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,When he pulled off the face pack, he looked terrible.Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,But I was waiting for that exact moment.Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.99,Main,,0,0,0,,By showing tears right there,Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:57.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I won his heart.Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:02.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I won't let your marriage with me be hell!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:07.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously, men are dumb.Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:26.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Then that idiot pulled me into his arms right then and there,Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,and said in a quiet whisper:Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,"You're my salvation. Let's get married."Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,"Let's get married."Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,"Let's get married!"Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:49.62,Main,,0,0,0,,"Let's get married!"Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! I can't breathe!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:54.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,That's such a pathetic proposal, don't you think?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:08.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was so funny!Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:14.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Who in the world would marry a failure like him?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:28.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Couldn't it have at least been a proper prince?Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:07:04.23,Title,,0,0,0,,Germa's FailureDialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:09.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying to get up?Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:09.70,Captions,,0,0,0,,Treasure RepositoryDialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:11.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:19.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Why? Why do you want to keep standing, Soul King?Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it because of the stone, Soul King?Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that more important to you than rescuing Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san is a kind man.Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I figured he'd never come back.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:47.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of trap you set for him...Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:53.22,Main,,0,0,0,,... but he's an extremely kind man,Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,so once he's made up his mind to sacrifice himself for someone, he will not change his mind!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:04.34,Main,,0,0,0,,And our captain, at the same time, is someone who always trusts his own beliefs when he acts!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why those two young men will decide what happens here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:14.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:18.84,Main,,0,0,0,,So you have nothing better to do than come for the stone?Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I am doing it so that if, in the worst-case scenario, Sanji-san does not return with us...Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,...He will not blame himself for bringing us here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:35.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I want him to know that this rescue mission was still beneficial!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,So I must get it! The Road Poneglyph!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:46.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Your worst-case scenario is too tame.Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.83,0:08:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji not returning? Is that really the worst that could happen?Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think it is.Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:57.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think nobody's gonna die?Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe all of you will die!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:06.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool draws up plans with the expectation of death, young lady?Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:16.15,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-WorldDialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:21.11,Main,,0,0,0,,St... St... Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:23.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Tickle, tickle, tickle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:28.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell us already!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:32.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot's special tickle, tickle, tickle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:34.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop tickling me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Just say it! If you don't, she'll tickle you forever!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:43.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll say it! I'll say it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Carrot, stop.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:53.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for this!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:57.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer our question. Which mirror leads to the castle?Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:10:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't remember every single mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:04.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not the right answer!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:07.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to ask the mirrors!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,– The mirrors? – Ask?Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! The mirrors all know what they're reflecting!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:26.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Which one of you is a mirror to the castle?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:30.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I am!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:31.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.78,Main,,0,0,0,,– It's me. – Me too.Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:38.03,Main,,0,0,0,,They answered!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,– Here! Me too! – Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:44.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the mirror in Galette-sama's closet.Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a hand mirror in a guest room on the second floor.Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:50.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a mirror in the ladies' room on the fourth floor.Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Do any of you currently reflect Luffy, Nami, Brook, Pedro or Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We're looking for them!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,– Who? – What do they look like?Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:03.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama passed by earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. They don't know what they look like.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:10.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Count on me, Chobro! I'm good at drawing!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Drawing?Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so unfortunate to have such a dumb brother.Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:24.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you really are!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:28.70,Main,,0,0,0,,If we leave her like this, she'll be dead before the morning.Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:33.87,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't let that happen. That'll ruin our whole plan.Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We need her to live until tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, Big Sister-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:59.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll give us trouble if you die like this.Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:02.43,Main,,0,0,0,,And it'll give us trouble if you reveal my ungraceful nature,Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:04.74,Main,,0,0,0,,as you've just seen.Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:20.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you...?Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay calm. It won't take long.Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.77,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the power of the Memo-Memo Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone has a roll of film in their head that records memories.Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You have scary experiences, sad memories,Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,and things that you wanna forget, don't you?Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:19.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed with Germa 66.Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:22.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You were shot in the leg, but you still made it that far.Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You're uselessly tough!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,She's right!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:33.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll paste a memory stripDialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:37.62,Main,,0,0,0,,from one of the soldiers who was shot by a stray bullet here and...Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,All done!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:50.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Your most recent memories involving me have been cut.Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:53.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a joyous wedding tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Call the soldiers and get her taken to the medical room.Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:58.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:14:01.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,Prison LibraryDialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! No!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:16.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously, stop it, Luffy! You're scaring me! That's enough!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:25.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Your arms are gonna really be torn apart!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:30.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care! I gotta tell Sanji about Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That rat!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I said don't do it! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:44.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow... A little more to go!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,He's so reckless-fa. Hey, girl.Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:51.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I'm busy now!Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.19,0:14:56.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama ordered me to get Lola's whereabouts out of you during the night-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,So just tell me now-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:01.28,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I'm not going to sell out my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:03.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, then. I'm gonna torture you-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Don't say that so casually!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm gonna shoot you with a crossbow once every five seconds,Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.75,0:15:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,so just tell me whenever you're ready-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:16.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What? What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:18.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do that... It'll kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.07,0:15:19.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Then just tell me-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:22.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Wart-head! I won't let you do that!Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:26.01,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay, Nami! I'll rip my arms off in the next five seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:27.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I don't want either of those to happen!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:31.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is anybody here?Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:41.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Whoa-whoa! I thought you weren't allowed to enter the castle now!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:46.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hardheaded. There is chaos all over this castle.Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:49.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to do this, Opera...Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:55.13,Main,,0,0,650,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Why don't you sleep for a while?Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:35.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy! Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard you got caught. I'm glad that you're okay.Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.22,0:16:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We can talk later.Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:50.39,Main,,0,0,0,,But first, don't you want to get out of there?Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:52.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We do!!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:56.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:58.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,Medical RoomDialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,She was bleeding badly, but the wound has already started healing.Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:07.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What incredibly resilient and regenerative skin.Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.41,0:17:12.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the true power of Germa's modified humans.Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:17.75,Main,,0,0,0,,If she stays in bed for the night, she should be able to attend the tea party tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.26,0:17:25.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Guard her for the rest of the night.Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:28.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to tell the Vinsmokes about this.Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're worried about her.Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.85,0:17:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:35.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I'll be in the medical office on the fourth floor.Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:42.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to sleep with the amount of wounded people that are in the castle right now.Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your service. Take care.Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Where am I?Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:11.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:16.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I hurt my leg...Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:20.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember how that happened?Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:25.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I was walking around the castle,Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.61,0:18:29.49,Main,,0,0,0,,and then I ran across soldiers who were going after intruders...Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,... and I got attacked, I suppose?Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:36.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense, does it? Of course not.Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:38.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Your memories were replaced.Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what really happened.Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.01,0:18:50.27,Captions,,0,30,1,,Prison LibraryDialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:53.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Books can be destroyed by fire.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:57.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna burn the cage? Is that a good idea?Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.23,0:19:02.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, but only if you two can get out of there before burning up.Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:04.69,Main,,0,0,0,,– Alright. Do it! – That quick?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.69,0:19:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm still not ready!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:12.03,Main,,0,0,0,,We're really gonna burn!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:14.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Burn it up already!Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.75,0:19:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Luffy! Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:43.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We got out!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've been through something like this before...Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, both of you.Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:58.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I didn't have to rip my arms apart!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:02.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, we met each other...Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:06.13,Main,,0,0,0,,... in a prison like this.Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.01,0:20:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! These people were all inside that book.Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:16.89,Main,,0,0,0,,The imagination and span of the World of Books is infinite.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:22.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom has many powerful followers just like Mont d'Or.Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:31.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jinbe! But why are you here?Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,My Sun Pirates are also affiliated with Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:40.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, but...Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:45.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That means this is...Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is a rebellion. There's no turning back now!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:52.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Is that okay?Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:56.36,Main,,0,0,0,,On Fishman Island, you said that you had other obligations.Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:58.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I just took care of them.Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:01.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone heard screams from the Prison Library!Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:04.44,Main,,0,0,0,,– What's going on?! – They've already noticed!Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:06.62,Main,,0,0,0,,They're indeed quick.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:10.99,Main,,0,0,0,,First, we have to hide in a place where they can't find us.Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yeah. – Let's go, then!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden... I feel hungry.Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:21.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You're hungry at a time like this?Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy expends three times the energy of a normal person when he does something.Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.67,0:21:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'm not saying that I wanna eat something.Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:36.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Your stomach is growling.Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Never mind!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:43.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I won't eat anything other than what you cook!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:47.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Even if I get hungry or spears rain down on me,Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.71,0:21:52.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll stay right here and wait for you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.57,0:21:55.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Jinbe, thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I actually...Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:05.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... was proposed to by Sanji-san.Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:09.32,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to marry him, because...Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:14.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... he's an idiot that played right into my hands by falling for me...Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:17.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... and because he's going to be shot in the middle of the ceremony...Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:19.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... by me.Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:22.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Things can't get any worse!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:27.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We were all fooled! Sanji, too! I gotta let him know!Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.10,0:22:29.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care of Nami, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:33.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait! There are tons of tough enemies in the castle!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.70,0:22:38.74,Main,,0,0,0,,And you're not fully recovered! Don't you remember what happened this morning?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:41.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be defeated this time!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.25,0:22:58.94,Captions,,0,0,0,,Medical RoomDialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:00.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you believe me?Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:05.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, I do. I know you wouldn't lie to me.Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:09.77,Main,,0,0,0,,But I didn't realize Pudding's true character was this heinous.Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.77,0:23:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't completely sure.Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But I thought she seemed a little too perfect,Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:17.79,Main,,0,0,0,,so I was spying on her myself.Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:23.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If she wasn't planning to marry me from the start, and if the plan was to kill us all along,Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,then the promise I was given that Luffy and the others would be safe...Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.08,0:23:33.38,Main,,0,0,0,,... was just a big lie!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.38,0:23:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I could sacrifice myself and everything would be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,But that was nothing but false hope! How could I have been so naive?Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:49.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Our father may be smart, but even he was careless in this situation.Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.52,0:23:55.94,Main,,0,0,0,,He's dealing with an Emperor. He should've been more careful.Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.94,0:23:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,But this is a good situation, in my opinion.Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I believe that Germa should be destroyed.Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.83,0:24:07.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just pretend I know nothing,Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.06,0:24:09.70,Main,,0,0,0,,and let Big Mom's plan be carried out...Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:14.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? If you go to the tea party, they'll kill you too, Reiju!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.04,0:24:17.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you worried about me?Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.43,0:24:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the problem with old memories.Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:28.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need to think that you're indebted to me for helping you that one time.Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.98,0:24:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave this island with the Straw Hats, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.52,0:24:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I can't do that! If I do that, what will happen to the Baratie?Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.98,0:24:41.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You can worry about that after you've escaped.Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.44,0:24:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,If you stay here, everybody will die.Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.80,0:24:48.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you can't die. For our mother's sake!Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.24,0:24:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:55.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a memory that I will never forget.Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.55,0:25:05.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.49,0:25:09.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother and Father had a big fight.Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:11.27,Main,,0,0,0,,It happened when I was a child.Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.27,0:25:16.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I always wondered why our sweet mother was so angry.Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:19.86,Main,,0,0,0,,But it made sense much later.Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.82,0:25:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,When our mother was pregnant with you four...Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.42,0:25:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,... she was strongly against turning you into emotionless machines.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.75,0:25:33.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– Are you serious?! – Of course I am!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.26,0:25:36.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,How can you want to do such a horrible thing?Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.27,0:25:39.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The operating room is ready.Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.13,0:25:42.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't do this! They're my children, too!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.19,0:25:46.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you get rid of their emotions, they won't be human anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.01,0:25:50.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I want them to be monsters. Winning wars is all that matters.Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.85,0:25:57.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The reestablishment of the Vinsmoke Family that once conquered the North Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.25,0:26:01.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Accomplishing that goal... requires strength.Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.04,0:26:04.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll give my children the greatest power possible!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.78,0:26:07.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– No! – Take her!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.86,0:26:10.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What are you– ? No! Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.05,0:26:13.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Honey! Don't do it! They're my children!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.20,0:26:14.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.03,0:26:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Then they performed the surgery.Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.71,0:26:28.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But our mother took pills to try and foil our father's plan.Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.86,0:26:46.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, what have you done, Sora?Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.38,0:26:51.37,Main,,0,0,0,,These pills were strong enough to affect the manipulated Bloodline Elements.Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.16,0:26:57.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But her actions weren't enough.Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.33,0:27:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,They soon found superhuman abnormalities in our brothers' bodies.Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.38,0:27:07.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.55,0:27:13.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– The surgery was a success. – Great!Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.43,0:27:19.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Their genetic blueprints won't be affected by some drug.Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.75,0:27:30.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's play!Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.71,0:27:34.93,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But it's strange. Only Sanji-sama is...Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.93,0:27:40.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That can't be right. Let's watch over his growth.Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.22,0:27:59.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry? Hold on.Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.28,0:28:00.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Here.Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.65,0:28:03.24,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Is it good?Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.07,0:28:08.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama is feeding birds!Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.02,0:28:10.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He mustn't have those kinds of emotions!Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.57,0:28:12.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sora!Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.75,0:28:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,As you grew up, you kept acting human.Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.92,0:28:21.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, our mother grew weaker and weaker,Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.42,0:28:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,because of the pills she took.Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.26,0:28:27.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... she died because of me?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.27,0:28:29.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think like that!Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.51,0:28:32.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mother...Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.80,0:28:36.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Reiju! Come here!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.42,0:28:39.23,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,How is your father doing?Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.05,0:28:43.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,All he does is train us. He never plays with us.Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.58,0:28:48.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's just happy that Ichiji, Niji and Yonji seem to be fine soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:51.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.87,0:28:53.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What is that?Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.34,0:28:57.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji cooked it for me!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.50,0:28:59.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji did?Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.88,0:29:08.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Can you guess what Sanji told me today?Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.12,0:29:12.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He said "Get well soon."Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:15.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's the sweetest boy in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.35,0:29:21.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.52,0:29:23.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Father...Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.05,0:29:31.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This compassion to lay flowers for the dead is useless to you!Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.96,0:29:47.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop crying!Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.86,0:29:51.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Coward!Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.51,0:29:53.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Crybaby!Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.87,0:29:57.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's go.Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.75,0:30:01.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You too. Come on.Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.08,0:30:04.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.38,0:30:11.37,Main,,0,0,0,,But our father's beliefs were the total opposite of our mother'sDialogue: 0,0:30:12.09,0:30:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,and he never accepted you for who you were.Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.87,0:30:24.40,Main,,0,0,0,,He blamed you for everything that happened, and mistreated you accordingly.Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.91,0:30:27.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare cook again!Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:31.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! Fight back!Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.32,0:30:37.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji is a worthless failure!Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.27,0:30:39.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Failure! Failure!Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.83,0:30:53.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Run!!Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.83,0:30:56.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!!Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.20,0:31:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though our mother is no longer with us, her grace is still there inside of you.Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.42,0:31:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way that you're a failure.Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.42,0:31:11.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Our mother protected her child at the risk of her own lifeDialogue: 0,0:31:11.27,0:31:14.67,Main,,0,0,0,,and he was born with the spark of humanity.Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.67,0:31:18.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That child is you, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.60,0:31:23.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why you're kinder than anyone else!Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.06,0:31:33.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Look for Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.11,0:31:34.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Which way did he go?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.78,0:31:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He escaped from the underground Prison Library and passed through the first floor already!Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.95,0:31:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,– Everyone, go to the second floor! – Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.08,0:31:48.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:48.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake Chateau – Second FloorDialogue: 0,0:31:49.08,0:31:53.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,In Front of the Door to the Treasure RepositoryDialogue: 0,0:31:50.37,0:31:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Another problem?Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.09,0:31:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. Boss Jinbe is in the castle and...Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.67,0:31:58.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not rebelling, is he?Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.52,0:32:01.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, send this message to all soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.72,0:32:03.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.93,0:32:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's plan is Mama's long-awaited dream.Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.64,0:32:11.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.31,0:32:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,– What will happen if we fail? – What?Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.19,0:32:18.26,Main,,0,0,0,,In the worst case scenario, what'll happen?Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.70,0:32:28.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I don't want to think about it!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.73,0:32:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Me neither.Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.25,0:32:35.03,Main,,0,0,0,,If we bring any more problems to Mama in her current mood,Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.03,0:32:37.30,Main,,0,0,0,,it'll affect tomorrow's mission.Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.30,0:32:39.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.47,0:32:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Then what shall we do?Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.38,0:32:46.23,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Are you telling me to lie...Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.23,0:32:48.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If you lie to Mama, you'll be executed.Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.79,0:32:51.13,Main,,0,0,0,,F-Forgive me!Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.13,0:32:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,If there isn't a problem, we don't need to tell her anything.Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.49,0:32:58.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.01,0:33:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I agree!Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.48,0:33:04.03,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on the fourth floor.Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.03,0:33:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Block all the paths up to this floor!Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.98,0:33:09.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Handle everything on the lower levels.Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.70,0:33:12.40,Main,,0,0,0,,And get the situation under control immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:15.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. Understood!Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.12,0:33:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, it's easier to kill them than to capture them!Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.34,0:33:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,– That's fine. You have my permission! – Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.13,0:33:27.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Sanji?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.57,0:33:35.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm asking where he is!Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.24,0:33:39.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you still thinking?Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:42.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You already have your answer.Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.61,0:33:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Abandon Germa and run away, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.75,0:33:51.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa clings to glories from the past, and stands for nothing but destruction.Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.74,0:33:54.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The world doesn't need us.Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.97,0:33:58.76,Main,,0,0,0,,All Big Mom wants is our advanced technology.Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.34,0:34:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I doubt she has any interest in the life of your mentor.Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.10,0:34:10.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Father and our brothers are the ones who are threatening to take that seafaring restaurant hostage...Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.34,0:34:11.98,Main,,0,0,0,,... and they'll be dead tomorrow, anyways.Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.52,0:34:17.11,Main,,0,0,0,,It's exactly what we deserve, since we're nothing but a band of murderers.Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.61,0:34:22.87,Main,,0,0,0,,My grudge is with them, but why do you have to die, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.57,0:34:26.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I still have my emotions...Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.44,0:34:31.53,Main,,0,0,0,,but I'm still a modified being that cannot disobey father's orders.Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.41,0:34:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,My hands are stained with blood, too.Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.96,0:34:36.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I deserve death.Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.80,0:34:42.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention it, but those bracelets...Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.60,0:34:47.68,Main,,0,0,0,,They won't explode on you. I swapped them out for ordinary ones.Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.87,0:34:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,So what else is keeping you here?Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.90,0:34:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Get your act together, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.87,0:35:03.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.13,0:35:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about what's important to you!Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.47,0:35:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,"What's important to me?"Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.75,0:35:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.47,0:35:22.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Join my crew!Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:24.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Be the cook on my pirate ship!Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.67,0:35:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.10,0:35:34.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're a good cook, so let's be pirates together!Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.81,0:35:37.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able to meet...Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.73,0:35:40.15,Main,,0,0,0,,... good friends...Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.15,0:35:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,... like them again!Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.58,0:35:46.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.52,0:35:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!!Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.11,0:35:53.90,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Titl